# Pairs with ListedInSink. A retire deletes the sink manifest while the row is
# still listed.
MODULE: ListedInSinkManifestBeforeRow
TARGET: ListedInSink
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a retire deletes the manifest before the row
PERTURBS: RetireMan

--- FIND
    /\ ret = "rowgone"
    /\ man' = "none"
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: the manifest may go first.
    /\ ret \in {"held", "rowgone"}
    /\ man' = "none"
--- END
